<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - June 5.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - June 5.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- The Italian government has provided just over a million dollars for an irrigated farmland project at Moamba district in southern Mozambique.</p>
<p>- Mozambique's ruling Frelimo party sent a message of congratulation to Lionel Jospin and his Socialist Party on their victory in the French general election.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
